<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland, 155 runs ahead of Western Australia on first innings, were 259 for six in their second innings at the close on the third day of the five-day Sheffield Shield final at the WACA on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Queensland 320 and 259-6; Western Australia 165.</p>
